  "description": "The BackroadFF stands for performance off the tarmac. Aerodynamics, comfort and catering were the top priorities during development – so that you can give your all in the race against yourself or others. Highlights of the Gravel-Race model platform • Gravel Race One-Piece Cockpit – built for speed • Plenty of tyre clearance – up to 45 mm tyre clearance • Integrated power meter – QUARQ measures your performance • Well thought-out bag concept – magnetic, practical, beautiful • Wolftooth Chainguide – keeps the chain where it belongs The BackroadFF Force XPLR AXS is also equipped with the Force XPLR AXS 1x13 groupset, ROSE GC50 wheels and Schwalbe G One RS Pro tyres as well as the Selle Italia Flite Boost Carbon saddle in combination with the ROSE Aero D-Shape seat post. * approx. 7.9 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour pistachio, size M, without pedals",
